class_name AizuItemKind extends Resource
## What a grabbable is, for the receivers it can be used on: a knife, a red key.
## Create one file per kind and drag it into the [code]kinds[/code] of the
## grabbable and into the item uses of the receivers that accept it.
##
## The resource has nothing to configure: the file itself is the identity, so a
## kind cannot be misspelled. Make a new file for every kind.
